.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt DMESG 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dmesg
.Nd print the system log ring
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens
.Pa log:
and reads the in-kernel log ring from its oldest retained record, writing the
records to the debug console.  The ring is owned by
.Xr logd 8 ; records older than the ring capacity are unavailable.
.Pp
.Fl -selftest
opens and reads the real ring and prints
.Dq dmesg: selftest ok .
An empty ring is a valid early-boot state, not an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
A missing log server exits with status 1.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr logd 8
.Sh STANDARDS
The log format is the RavenBSD
.Pa raven-logd
record format, not the POSIX
.Nm
interface.
